{"product_id":"brain-games-for-adults-mixed-puzzles-and-smart-brainteasers-to-challenge-your-iq","title":"Brain Games for Adults: Mixed Puzzles and Smart Brainteasers to Challenge Your IQ","description":"\u003cp\u003ePut some fun into your puzzling with these clever games, specially designed to give your brain a workout while also making you smile!It's common knowledge that a brain workout is essential for keeping your mind on top form but often the puzzles we turn to can seem like very hard work. With Brain Games for Adults, internationally renowned puzzle expert Dr. Gareth Moore presents a huge variety of puzzles – from cryptic codes to logic puzzles, number puzzles to feats of memory – that will challenge you and help boost your IQ. With different types of puzzles, all timed and all evolving in levels of difficulty as you work through the book, that challenge will continue as you progress and build your skills.From the author of the bestselling children's puzzle book series, Brain Games For Clever Kids®\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 129 x 198\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Gareth Moore\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781789293821\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 192\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45890760736921,"sku":"14RC9781789293821","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/69156cea5520a_Brain_Games_for_Adults_Mixed_Puzzles_and_Smart_Brainteasers_to_Challenge_Your_IQ.jpg?v=1763046296","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/brain-games-for-adults-mixed-puzzles-and-smart-brainteasers-to-challenge-your-iq","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}